{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1000_place", "source_sha256": "ca283fa4c715964e279d66bef67cfd29ca26053c56d939db10703758cd14d25a", "ja": "屋外ステージ袖", "zh": "户外舞台侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4b9b54f90d4a2950dd2a86631fae5bd148420b3ddf722aeaf2a26a8b2e2a3106", "ja": "（さっきから、環が静かだ。ヒーローショーの仕事を\nあんなに楽しみにしてたのに、どうしたんだ？）", "zh": "（环从刚刚开始就很安静，她之前明明那么期待\n英雄秀的工作，是怎么了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2cbb6d60af7d469768fac1564b71de00fc8fafeb08c68e02a3a5e9c267471a77", "ja": "……うう～っ、なんだこれっ！　むずかしい\n漢字がいっぱいで、ぜんぜん読めないぞっ！", "zh": "……呜呜～这是怎样！每个字都好难，\n环完全不会念呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "b144841653d635de73d1be21cdf58bce247e086dedf6628de799142b6b8fa3f5", "ja": "ねぇおやぶん、これなんて読むの？\nあと、こっちと……この漢字も！", "zh": "欸，老大，这个字怎么念？\n还有这个……和这个字！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e668fe0d3fb0ed98fd37a985e6c34a545bf3d593b5c444ccf9341760ee83288", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……確かに、この台本はちょっと\n環には難しいな。なら、フリガナを振っておくよ。", "zh": "嗯，原来如此……这份剧本对环来说确实\n是有点难啊，那我帮你标上读音吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "a994de320b97ca52fc0145631b0312f7bef0e426bf31b30b3dc5d9576232866a", "ja": "ホント！？　ありがとー、おやぶん！\nたまき、お仕事頑張るっ！", "zh": "真的吗！？谢谢你～老大！\n环会好好努力工作的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
